                <pb facs="0919" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg821"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Corea to the
                            Department of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua, Nicaragua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Government resolved definitively July 30 devolution duties American merchants
                    regards.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Corea.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
